CyberChef Responsive build script

This project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by GCHQ.

It does not include any CyberChef source code. At build time it downloads the official CyberChef
source (https://github.com/gchq/CyberChef, Copyright Crown Copyright, Apache License 2.0),
injects the CSS and JavaScript in the assets/ folder into its page template and builds it.
The resulting site is a modified version of CyberChef and stays under the Apache License 2.0;
it announces that it is modified in its "Download CyberChef" and "About / Support" dialogs.
